"name": "Duke Energy Corporation",
"description": "Duke Energy Corp. engages in the distribution of natural gas and energy-related services. It operates through the following segments: Electric Utilities and Infrastructure (EU&I) and Gas Utilities and Infrastructure (GU&I). The EU&I segment conducts operations in regulated electric utilities in the Carolinas, Florida and the Midwest. The GU&I segment focuses on Piedmont, natural gas local distribution companies in Ohio and Kentucky, and natural gas storage and midstream pipeline investments. The company was founded on April 30, 1904 and is headquartered in Charlotte, NC.",
